 system as deep and robust as this, they were wise to adapt, else they\u2019d just be hanging around in ponds all day waiting to be added to that \u201c10 million\u201d statistic. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The sky(box) is the limit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/ea1bb0f58dd0a44e50357ad4cae9a70b.poster.avif?t=1753689923\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/ea1bb0f58dd0a44e50357ad4cae9a70b.webm?t=1753689923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/ea1bb0f58dd0a44e50357ad4cae9a70b.mp4?t=1753689923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you really a Duck if you can\u2019t fly? No, you\u2019re a penguin or something.<strong> So yes, you CAN fly</strong>;  we\u2019ve introduced an egg-cellent player controller with sophisticated flight mechanics allowing you to glide, hover, accelerate and dive, even whilst shooting and fighting!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world of fowl play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alive Duck can keep his gear safe and his teammates alive..  A dead duck however, is much less useful. Afterall - birds of a feather stay together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/ee4a7788bb6db5e23e9b918f2f80857d.poster.avif?t=1753689923\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/ee4a7788bb6db5e23e9b918f2f80857d.webm?t=1753689923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/ee4a7788bb6db5e23e9b918f2f80857d.mp4?t=1753689923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t be a duckling - get yourself equipped, build nests for safety, storage, survival, and strategic advantage, but be warned: nothing is truly safe. Every structure can be destroyed, every stash of loot raided, and every migration could end in death. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There\u2019s no such thing as <i>too many</i> ducks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or create a flock with other ducks to build, explore, fight, and survive together. Ducks are fiercely territorial, so encounters with opposing ducks can and will often result in some feathers being ruffled.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/6115b634a677bfaa5d0189d74454d1e8.poster.avif?t=1753689923\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/6115b634a677bfaa5d0189d74454d1e8.webm?t=1753689923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/6115b634a677bfaa5d0189d74454d1e8.mp4?t=1753689923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARE YOU GONNA BE A SITTING DUCK, OR A BIRD OF PREY?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/278384aee9cc73f6a03e77d66bc6cf9f.avif?t=1753689923\" width=540 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/extras/f25d3f0dcf98cb41136023e4308e3c15.avif?t=1753689923\" width=600 height=170 /></span></p>","developers":["tinyBuild Riga"],"dlc":[3102060,3802310],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682580/header.jpg?t=1753689923","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2682580/761170/5931e7a0ff071fd747eb9a5a4b5a6d6939354ed2/1750818621/dash_av1.mpd?t=1727273140","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2682580/761170/5931e7a0ff071fd747eb9a5a4b5a6d6939354ed2/1750818621/dash_h264.mpd?t=1727273140","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2682580/761170/5931e7a0ff071fd747eb9a5a4b5a6d6939354ed2/1750818621/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1727273140","id":257058376,"name":"DUCKSIDE - EA!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257058376/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1727273140"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2682580/710199/6ae737a41ee04d1ba6281375b32f135e4e1990ab/1750818621/dash_av1.mpd?t=1721397468","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2682580/710199/6ae737a41ee04d1ba6281375b32f135e4e1990ab/1750818621/dash_h264.mpd?t=1721397468","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2682580/710199/6ae737a41ee04d1ba6281375b32f135e4e1990ab/1750818621/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1721397468","id":257028864,"name":"DUCKSIDE - Dem